  have h2 : i < (walkPieceList ++ layoutExtraPieceList ++ frag1ExtraPieceList ++ frag2ExtraPieceList ++ topExtraPieceList ++ proExtraPieceList ++ numIdPadPieceList ++ numIdExtraPieceList ++ proAxmExtraPieceList : List V).length := by
